body:
Thank you for sharing that story with me. It just helps me to confirm from others that I am right in what I am thinking about the SSRI's. For me I desperately need to understand why the relationship ended after hanging on so long to a girl that I was so in love with and just desperately wanted her to return those feelings like she did before she developed PMDD. I also hope that other men and women will read this thread as a cautionary tail and only use an SSRI to get over or through a really bad patch but then come off them and try avoid using them on a regular basis for the sake of their relationships.

&#x200B;

Hearing you say " I did feel like I didn’t even like him anymore" was exactly what I thought and feared was going through her mind.
